   113	
   114	1. **The cutoff:** one for every matter, the end of the invocation's last day (09-20 in the full run). Libraries are read as they stand then.
   115	   - Closed questions still count.
   116	   - Timeliness is not scored. The days from first source to opening are printed beside.
