v6 closes the replacement loophole, but the verdict can still change depending on which rule the scorer follows. For example, if there are too few yes/no answers to judge that guardrail and the figure guardrail fails under both countings, one clause says “no practical winner” and another says “practical loss.” D665 requires a loss. [Plan §1.4](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v6.md:147) · [Verdict order](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v6.md:169) · [D665](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/DECISIONS-log.md:9415)

- **Replacement timing — resolved.** All six original draws must finish. A replacement is diagnostic only. **New gap:** v6 adopts D431’s calendar-day reading, but Stage 2 still allows six completed draws to produce a verdict if sends cross midnight, including an eligible redo. Before launch, fix the send-day rule for the original six draws and state that a breach makes the result diagnostic. [Plan §1.4](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v6.md:163) · [Stage 2](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v6.md:239) · [D431](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/DECISIONS-log.md:4800)
- **Split counting — partly resolved.** The plan fixes which way each system’s splits go, where insufficient marks count, and the minimum of ten unsplit decisions per system. The remaining fix is one sentence: an undersized subgroup cannot breach and blocks a practical lead. A loss established by the paired result or another guardrail still stands. [Plan §1.4](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v6.md:141) · [PRD §1.5](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/clean-arch/PRD.md:139)
- **Renamed source copies — resolved, with a new gap.** The content match catches renamed copies, but it exempts the whole file. A database with a qualifying `items` table and a trace table would escape the census. Exempt only the raw source rows and still scan the rest of the file. [Plan §1.2](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/RUN-PLAN-v6.md:59) · [D665](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/DECISIONS-log.md:9411)

NOT READY: enforce same-day eligibility, preserve independently established losses, and limit the source-copy exemption to raw source rows.
